{
    "title": "GlobalComix: Comic Book Reader",
    "description": "Read iconic comic books like Batman, Superman, Invincible, Transformers, The Walking Dead, The Boys, Hellboy, The Witcher, The Umbrella Academy and more, alongside exciting creator-made comics, manga, webcomics, and graphic novels.\r\n\r\nNEW BOOKS DROP WEEKLY\r\nFind new and interesting books featured weekly. Explore our library of over 70,000+ releases through curated collections and see which books, creators and themes are trending. Your next favorite awaits!\r\n\r\nGC VERTICAL ORIGINALS\r\nExperience amazing  traditional comic book stories carefully remastered for vertical scroll. Over 600+ episodes across 30+ series from top indie publishers and creators. Get free episodes daily and new series weekly!\r\n\r\n350+ PUBLISHERS AND THOUSANDS OF CREATORS\r\nPublishers include DC, Image Comics, Dark Horse Comics, BOOM! Studios, ONI Press, AWA, Humanoids, TopCow, Mad Cave, Valiant, Heavy Metal, TOKYOPOP, TKO Studios, Source Point, and A Wave Blue World. Read comics like Justice League, Joker, Nightwing, The Sandman, Hellblazer, Stranger Things, The Mask, Cyberpunk 2077, Invincible, The Walking Dead, Spawn, Rick & Morty, Power Rangers, Transformers, The Boys, Smurfs, Satellite Sam, The Darkness, Radiant Black and thousands more. \r\n\r\nREADING EXPERIENCE YOU'LL LOVE\r\nRead the way you like and have everything you need at your fingertips. Whether you read on tablet or phone, prefer vertical scroll, single or double page layouts, you can customize it the way you like. You can also easily comment, follow the artist, or jump between releases. For comics that support it, you\u2019ll also have the option to enable our panel-to-panel reading experience.\r\n\r\nADVANCED SEARCH AND DISCOVERY\r\nDedicated channels for top publishers that go beyond algorithms. Discover new favorites through channels for top publishers. Find exactly what you\u2019re by looking for by filtering across genres, themes, art styles, formats, audiences, and more. If you know what you\u2019re into, you can search for it.\r\n\r\nOFFLINE READING\r\nWhile traveling or on-the-go, download your favorite comics to read while offline from our vast library. Grab your GlobalComix Gold subscription to unlock this feature.\r\n\r\nTRACK TITLES  & ORGANIZE COMICS\r\nBookmark your comics with statuses like \u201cReading\u201d, \u201cOn Hold\u201d, and \u201cRead later\u201d so you can pick it back up later or continue where you left off. You can even get notified when there\u2019s a new release from your favorite titles or creators. \r\n\r\nCELEBRATE COMICS AND THE PEOPLE WHO CREATE THEM\r\nGlobalComix is a platform where creators and publishers can publish on our website \u2014 either for free or with paid access \u2014 and up to 70% of your subscription fee is distributed among owners of the content you read.\r\n\r\nJoin us and shape the future of comics!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Read iconic comic books like Batman, Superman, Invincible, Transformers, The Walking Dead, The Boys, Hellboy, The Witcher, The Umbrella Academy and more, alongside exciting creator-made comics, manga, webcomics, and graphic novels.<br><br>NEW BOOKS DROP WEEKLY<br>Find new and interesting books featured weekly. Explore our library of over 70,000+ releases through curated collections and see which books, creators and themes are trending. Your next favorite awaits!<br><br>GC VERTICAL ORIGINALS<br>Experience amazing  traditional comic book stories carefully remastered for vertical scroll. Over 600+ episodes across 30+ series from top indie publishers and creators. Get free episodes daily and new series weekly!<br><br>350+ PUBLISHERS AND THOUSANDS OF CREATORS<br>Publishers include DC, Image Comics, Dark Horse Comics, BOOM! Studios, ONI Press, AWA, Humanoids, TopCow, Mad Cave, Valiant, Heavy Metal, TOKYOPOP, TKO Studios, Source Point, and A Wave Blue World. Read comics like Justice League, Joker, Nightwing, The Sandman, Hellblazer, Stranger Things, The Mask, Cyberpunk 2077, Invincible, The Walking Dead, Spawn, Rick &amp; Morty, Power Rangers, Transformers, The Boys, Smurfs, Satellite Sam, The Darkness, Radiant Black and thousands more. <br><br>READING EXPERIENCE YOU&#39;LL LOVE<br>Read the way you like and have everything you need at your fingertips. Whether you read on tablet or phone, prefer vertical scroll, single or double page layouts, you can customize it the way you like. You can also easily comment, follow the artist, or jump between releases. For comics that support it, you\u2019ll also have the option to enable our panel-to-panel reading experience.<br><br>ADVANCED SEARCH AND DISCOVERY<br>Dedicated channels for top publishers that go beyond algorithms. Discover new favorites through channels for top publishers. Find exactly what you\u2019re by looking for by filtering across genres, themes, art styles, formats, audiences, and more. If you know what you\u2019re into, you can search for it.<br><br>OFFLINE READING<br>While traveling or on-the-go, download your favorite comics to read while offline from our vast library. Grab your GlobalComix Gold subscription to unlock this feature.<br><br>TRACK TITLES  &amp; ORGANIZE COMICS<br>Bookmark your comics with statuses like \u201cReading\u201d, \u201cOn Hold\u201d, and \u201cRead later\u201d so you can pick it back up later or continue where you left off. You can even get notified when there\u2019s a new release from your favorite titles or creators. <br><br>CELEBRATE COMICS AND THE PEOPLE WHO CREATE THEM<br>GlobalComix is a platform where creators and publishers can publish on our website \u2014 either for free or with paid access \u2014 and up to 70% of your subscription fee is distributed among owners of the content you read.<br><br>Join us and shape the future of comics!",
